  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Strengthening of Election Management Bodies (EMB) and Accountability Institutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This will include short-term Technical Advisory Support to provide capacity building support to Government of Ghana (GoG) departments and agencies and Parliament, partnerships with multilaterals to leverage on interventions that aligns with demand for accountability. This will also include partnerships with other HMG Departments, GoG agencies and departments to identify opportunities to achieve programme&apos;s objectives through peer-to-peer partnerships between GoG and HMG departments.</narrative>
  </description>
